WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:03.460
<b>Haruka North High School</b>

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:16.830
Oh, Shiraishi-kun!

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:18.630
Good morning!

00:00:19.250 --> 00:00:20.250
Good morning.

00:00:21.170 --> 00:00:23.750
