00:00:24.330 --> 00:00:27.080
Um, thanks for letting me shower here.

00:00:27.670 --> 00:00:29.080
Don't mention it.

00:00:29.750 --> 00:00:32.960
Thanks for the tracksuit too. I'll wash it and return it.

00:00:34.420 --> 00:00:35.830
Thanks!

00:00:36.250 --> 00:00:38.250
No, I should be saying that.

00:00:38.540 --> 00:00:40.460
Was it small on you?

00:00:40.710 --> 00:00:41.380
Yeah.

00:00:41.880 --> 00:00:42.880
Oh, okay.

00:00:46.420 --> 00:00:49.210
How tall are you?

00:00:49.210 --> 00:00:49.880
Huh?

00:00:50.420 --> 00:00:51.130
Huh?

00:00:52.080 --> 00:00:52.880
Uh...

00:00:53.670 --> 00:00:54.920
Aah...

00:00:55.750 --> 00:00:57.540
I'm five foot four.

00:00:57.880 --> 00:00:59.080
Really?

00:00:59.790 --> 00:01:02.540
I'm five foot three.

00:01:06.250 --> 00:01:08.000
It's about this much.

00:01:08.630 --> 00:01:09.670
What is?

00:01:10.040 --> 00:01:11.540
Six inches.

00:01:12.920 --> 00:01:16.880
That's generally considered
the ideal height difference for a couple.

00:01:17.130 --> 00:01:17.750
Cou-

00:01:18.210 --> 00:01:19.790
Isn't the man supposed to be taller?

00:01:20.130 --> 00:01:21.460
It doesn't matter to me.

00:01:22.080 --> 00:01:22.790
It doesn't?

00:01:25.380 --> 00:01:29.130
This height difference makes me wanna pat your head.

00:01:31.250 --> 00:01:35.130
Seriously, what's up with her suddenly
getting so close like this?

00:01:35.960 --> 00:01:39.460
Shiraishi-kun, do you wish you were taller?

00:01:39.790 --> 00:01:43.290
Well, it'd be nice to be taller.

00:01:43.580 --> 00:01:47.670
I gotcha. Rather than a six inch difference...

00:01:58.130 --> 00:02:00.250
I prefer this.

00:02:02.250 --> 00:02:03.540
Just kidding.

00:03:41.580 --> 00:03:44.040
It's almost the end of the second semester.

00:03:42.580 --> 00:03:44.460
<b>End of second semester exam</b>

00:03:42.580 --> 00:03:44.460
<b>Schedule</b>

00:03:42.590 --> 00:03:44.460
<b>Japanese</b>

00:03:44.710 --> 00:03:47.500
Full-blown winter is just around the corner.

00:03:44.960 --> 00:03:49.580
<b>Episode 3: The Nobody's Gift</b>

00:03:49.170 --> 00:03:52.580
All right, it's time to collect everyone's answer sheets!

00:03:52.960 --> 00:03:54.210
We're done!

00:03:55.000 --> 00:03:56.960
School lets out in the morning today.

00:03:57.540 --> 00:03:58.330
Right.

00:03:58.880 --> 00:04:00.380
