00:04:10.000 --> 00:04:12.670
Nagisa, how'd the test go for you?

00:04:12.670 --> 00:04:14.960
Oh, yeah. It was fine.

00:04:15.210 --> 00:04:18.080
That's Kubocchi for you. Cool as a cucumber!

00:04:18.080 --> 00:04:19.710
What'd you think of the test, Tama?

00:04:20.210 --> 00:04:21.460
Don't ask.

00:04:36.460 --> 00:04:39.080
There's a little boy alone at the park.

00:04:40.540 --> 00:04:43.630
Honey, are you by yourself? Where's your mom?

00:04:43.630 --> 00:04:44.330
Huh?

00:04:45.040 --> 00:04:46.830
