00:04:47.420 --> 00:04:50.000
Um, I'm here.

00:04:50.420 --> 00:04:51.290
Eek!

00:04:52.210 --> 00:04:53.330
I'm watching him.

00:04:53.540 --> 00:04:54.330
What?

00:04:54.920 --> 00:04:55.880
Big bwutha!

00:04:56.460 --> 00:04:57.670
I'm his older brother.

00:04:57.670 --> 00:05:01.330
Oh, I'm so sorry! I could've swore he was alone!

00:05:02.130 --> 00:05:03.000
It's okay.

00:05:03.500 --> 00:05:05.630
Thank you for your concern.

00:05:07.290 --> 00:05:09.670
Sorry about all that, Seita.

00:05:10.460 --> 00:05:11.130
Huh?

00:05:11.920 --> 00:05:13.710
Nah, it's nothing.

00:05:15.460 --> 00:05:18.880
I'm happy to take Seita to play
in the snow like I promised,

00:05:20.080 --> 00:05:23.630
but it stinks that people think he's by himself.

00:05:25.000 --> 00:05:26.130
Big bwutha!

00:05:29.880 --> 00:05:30.960
Here go!

00:05:32.540 --> 00:05:33.540
Thanks.

00:05:35.130 --> 00:05:36.580
The snow's freezing.

00:05:38.790 --> 00:05:39.790
It's cold.

00:05:39.790 --> 00:05:41.210
I don't wanna move.

00:05:42.170 --> 00:05:44.750
But that's okay, because Seita
looks like he's having a blast.

00:05:46.790 --> 00:05:49.250
<b>Cocoa</b>

00:05:46.790 --> 00:05:49.250
<b>With fresh cream</b>

00:05:47.000 --> 00:05:48.790
Found ya, Shiraishi-kun!

00:05:49.830 --> 00:05:50.790
Kubo-san!

