00:05:55.380 --> 00:05:56.080
Yeah.

00:05:56.380 --> 00:05:59.250
But your faces don't like alike at all.

00:05:59.540 --> 00:06:03.250
Seita takes after our mom, and I take after our dad.

00:06:03.710 --> 00:06:06.000
So these are the plans you mentioned earlier?

00:06:06.420 --> 00:06:10.790
Since it snowed, I promised
to take Seita to play at the park.

00:06:11.290 --> 00:06:12.330
I gotcha.

00:06:14.080 --> 00:06:15.080
Big bwutha.

00:06:15.830 --> 00:06:18.290
Seita, can you tell her hello?

00:06:24.630 --> 00:06:25.580
Hewwo.

00:06:25.880 --> 00:06:27.170
Hello.

00:06:28.040 --> 00:06:29.460
Good job.

00:06:29.960 --> 00:06:32.080
Big bwutha, big bwutha!

00:06:32.670 --> 00:06:34.540
He calls you big bwutha...

00:06:34.540 --> 00:06:35.880
That's so cute!

00:06:39.460 --> 00:06:41.330
Do you want to drink this?

00:06:41.830 --> 00:06:45.130
Big bwutha, I like that! Drink!

00:06:46.790 --> 00:06:49.670
No can do. That belongs to her.

00:06:51.830 --> 00:06:55.380
It's all right, you can have it. I still haven't opened it.

00:06:55.710 --> 00:06:57.250
Okay, here you go.

00:06:57.710 --> 00:06:59.210
Sorry, Kubo-san.

00:06:59.670 --> 00:07:01.420
No, it's okay.

00:07:02.040 --> 00:07:03.580
Big bwutha, drink!

00:07:04.170 --> 00:07:07.500
