00:07:45.790 --> 00:07:47.790
Mmm, yummy!

00:07:47.790 --> 00:07:48.920
Thank you.

00:07:49.750 --> 00:07:50.790
Big bwutha!

00:07:50.790 --> 00:07:52.670
Yep, that's great.

00:07:52.670 --> 00:07:53.790
Here go!

00:07:54.000 --> 00:07:57.040
Huh? I'm good. I don't want any.

00:07:57.040 --> 00:07:58.170
Here go!

00:07:58.790 --> 00:07:59.920
Seita...

00:08:00.290 --> 00:08:01.670
Here go.

00:08:05.040 --> 00:08:06.290
Big bwutha.

00:08:08.630 --> 00:08:10.080
Shiraishi-kun.

00:08:11.670 --> 00:08:12.830
Here go.

00:08:17.170 --> 00:08:18.290
