00:09:02.420 --> 00:09:07.460
Ah! On cold days, there really is nothing better
than reading manga in my room.

00:09:07.830 --> 00:09:08.710
Eh?

00:09:13.210 --> 00:09:18.670
The manga I've been into lately, Monarchy,
has really been keeping me on pins and needles.

00:09:19.500 --> 00:09:21.880
Ahh, it's toasty.

00:09:24.000 --> 00:09:28.960
<b>Phoenix Bookstore</b>

00:09:24.500 --> 00:09:30.580
I want the Monarchy bonus poster that's included
with the latest release of a weekly magazine,

00:09:30.580 --> 00:09:33.040
which is why I'm at a bookstore
that's far away from my house.

00:09:34.330 --> 00:09:36.580
I can buy it at the convenience store down the street,

00:09:37.290 --> 00:09:41.750
