00:10:19.630 --> 00:10:23.670
Th-this is one of those so-called adult magazines.

00:10:19.960 --> 00:10:23.920
<b>Sunset</b>

00:10:19.960 --> 00:10:23.920
<b>Entertainment</b>

00:10:19.960 --> 00:10:23.920
