00:10:38.330 --> 00:10:40.460
<b>Shiraishi</b>

00:10:38.330 --> 00:10:40.460
<b>Shiraishi opened his eyes wide!!</b>

00:10:40.500 --> 00:10:42.580
<b>Special bonus DVD</b>

00:10:40.830 --> 00:10:41.580
