00:10:43.420 --> 00:10:47.960
<b>Sunset</b>

00:10:43.420 --> 00:10:47.960
<b>Entertainment</b>

00:10:43.420 --> 00:10:47.960
<b>Sister-in-law, boss, senpai, neighbor</b>

00:10:43.420 --> 00:10:47.960
<b>Special edition: seduced into</b>

00:10:43.420 --> 00:10:47.960
<b>forbidden love by attractive older sister</b>

00:10:43.420 --> 00:10:47.960
<b>"I'll teach you everything."</b>

00:10:43.500 --> 00:10:47.210
The girl on the cover looks a little like Kubo-san.

00:10:51.330 --> 00:10:52.540
Hmmm.

00:10:54.330 --> 00:10:58.630
Hold up, I've got a hunch
