00:11:04.130 --> 00:11:05.080
<b>Shiraishi</b>

00:11:04.130 --> 00:11:05.080
<b>Shiraishi can't escape!!</b>

00:11:05.420 --> 00:11:11.290
Someone else left this here after flipping through it,
and I was just gonna put it back where it belongs.

00:11:11.290 --> 00:11:13.670
