00:11:15.290 --> 00:11:21.080
I didn't lie, even if, hypothetically, my ulterior
motive was to take a teensy look.

00:11:21.080 --> 00:11:22.460
It's still not a lie.

00:11:23.790 --> 00:11:27.210
Gotcha, gotcha. Then I guess we'll leave it at that.

00:11:28.130 --> 00:11:29.000
