00:11:50.210 --> 00:11:54.330
The only person who can spot me like that is Kubo-san.

00:11:54.420 --> 00:11:55.790
<b>Kubo</b>

00:11:56.330 --> 00:11:57.920
Insane déjà vu!

00:11:57.920 --> 00:12:02.170
Maybe people with the last name
Kubo can easily see me.

00:12:03.130 --> 00:12:05.170
Well, I'm ready to pay.

00:12:03.250 --> 00:12:06.750
<b>Young Jump</b>

00:12:05.170 --> 00:12:06.080
Okay!

00:12:07.040 --> 00:12:09.830
