00:12:16.330 --> 00:12:18.790
<b>Haruka North High School</b>

00:12:20.880 --> 00:12:22.880
That kid's a Haruka North High student.

00:12:24.710 --> 00:12:29.170
Hey, I'm back! Your sister's home!

00:12:30.130 --> 00:12:33.210
