00:13:33.880 --> 00:13:34.630
Okay.

00:13:35.040 --> 00:13:35.960
Thank you.

00:13:36.380 --> 00:13:38.500
I'm kinda surprised she gave it back just like tha-

00:13:42.630 --> 00:13:45.750
No way she would. It's Kubo-san.

00:13:48.080 --> 00:13:51.380
My sister found it at a bookstore.

00:13:51.380 --> 00:13:52.710
Oh, okay.

00:13:54.210 --> 00:13:55.080
Um...

00:13:55.920 --> 00:13:57.040
Kubo-san?

00:13:59.250 --> 00:14:02.330
Shiraishi-kun, do...

00:14:02.670 --> 00:14:03.500
Do?

00:14:04.630 --> 00:14:07.130
Do you like big boobs?

00:14:07.420 --> 00:14:09.040
Huh? What'd you say?

00:14:10.750 --> 00:14:12.750
Do you like big boobs?

00:14:13.670 --> 00:14:14.460
Huh?

00:14:14.460 --> 00:14:24.420
<b>Porno</b>

00:14:14.460 --> 00:14:24.420
<b>mag</b>

00:14:14.460 --> 00:14:24.420
<b>Shiraishi</b>

