00:14:21.920 --> 00:14:24.420
<b>So that means the bookstore employee</b>

00:14:21.920 --> 00:14:24.420
<b>from the other day is Kubo-san's sister!</b>

00:14:25.000 --> 00:14:29.460
That's totally why she's looking
