00:15:40.710 --> 00:15:44.080
Hey, is Shiraishi here? The teacher's asking for him.

00:15:44.080 --> 00:15:46.040
Come to think of it, I haven't seen him today.

00:15:47.170 --> 00:15:53.290
Having to announce that I'm here so
others notice me is a daily occurrence.

00:15:53.540 --> 00:15:54.880
Yet at the same time...

00:15:55.380 --> 00:15:56.540
Shiraishi-kun.

00:15:57.250 --> 00:16:00.540
The teacher wants you. You gotta go to the staff room.

00:16:01.420 --> 00:16:03.580
Kubo-san can find me.

00:16:05.540 --> 00:16:06.710
What'd you do?

00:16:06.500 --> 00:16:08.040
Oh, isn't that Shiraishi?

00:16:07.330 --> 00:16:08.460
I didn't do anything.

00:16:08.040 --> 00:16:09.540
Huh, where?

00:16:08.710 --> 00:16:10.000
I'm going right now.

00:16:11.670 --> 00:16:14.750
Hey, it's almost Christmas! I can't wait!

00:16:14.750 --> 00:16:16.750
Lucky! Where are you and your boyfriend going?

00:16:16.750 --> 00:16:19.580
We're planning on looking at Christmas lights.

00:16:19.580 --> 00:16:20.920
Really? I'm so jealous!

00:16:23.920 --> 00:16:26.830
Welcome back. How was the talk with the teacher?

00:16:27.420 --> 00:16:29.580
He forgot to give back my notebook.

00:16:29.580 --> 00:16:30.790
Really?

00:16:34.130 --> 00:16:35.500
Hey, Shiraishi-kun.

00:16:35.880 --> 00:16:37.710
Do you remember our promise?

00:16:38.290 --> 00:16:39.380
Our promise?

00:16:39.830 --> 00:16:42.210
Yeah. To hang out sometime.

00:16:42.920 --> 00:16:43.830
Oh.

00:16:43.830 --> 00:16:45.290
<b>We should hang out</b>

00:16:43.830 --> 00:16:45.290
<b>together sometime</b>

00:16:43.840 --> 00:16:45.290
<b>Shiraishi-kun</b>

00:16:43.840 --> 00:16:45.290
<b>All right</b>

00:16:47.630 --> 00:16:49.130
Oh, yeah.

00:16:50.250 --> 00:16:51.830
Do you have any free days?

00:16:52.500 --> 00:16:53.880
A free day?

00:16:54.210 --> 00:16:56.500
<b>Shiraishi</b>

00:16:54.210 --> 00:16:56.500
<b>Shiraishi has zero plans!</b>

00:16:54.880 --> 00:16:55.750
Um...

00:16:57.420 --> 00:16:58.710
Any day.

00:16:59.170 --> 00:17:02.170
Really? Then the Saturday after next,

00:17:02.330 --> 00:17:04.790
at 1 PM in front of the train station. How about that?

00:17:05.290 --> 00:17:06.290
That's fine.

00:17:06.790 --> 00:17:08.380
Then that sounds like a plan.

00:17:08.580 --> 00:17:15.040
<b>No events</b>

00:17:08.880 --> 00:17:11.420
The Saturday after next.

00:17:12.460 --> 00:17:14.670
Wait. That day is...

00:17:14.670 --> 00:17:16.790
Ch-Christmas.

00:17:17.210 --> 00:17:19.040
Oh, I can't wait!

00:17:22.500 --> 00:17:25.500
I'm so nervous I arrived thirty minutes early.

00:17:26.210 --> 00:17:27.460
What should I do?

00:17:27.880 --> 00:17:31.380
I know I don't register on most people's field of vision,

00:17:31.670 --> 00:17:34.540
but it makes it way harder
to dodge other people in crowds!

00:17:36.500 --> 00:17:39.830
Kubo-san's not here yet. I'll sit down.

00:17:43.170 --> 00:17:45.040
Let's rest here for a bit, honey.

00:17:45.330 --> 00:17:47.500
Yes, let's do that, darling.

00:17:48.330 --> 00:17:49.830
Bah, humbug, Christmas!

00:17:53.670 --> 00:17:54.750
It's cold.

00:17:57.130 --> 00:17:58.630
Still ten more minutes.

00:17:59.880 --> 00:18:01.670
It's 12:50 PM.

00:18:02.080 --> 00:18:02.710
Hmm?

00:18:03.580 --> 00:18:06.750
Should this be considered keeping you waiting?

00:18:09.880 --> 00:18:12.630
You're early, Shiraishi-kun. Did you have to wait?

00:18:12.830 --> 00:18:15.920
Uh, ah, I just got here.

00:18:16.790 --> 00:18:17.670
Really?

00:18:18.750 --> 00:18:20.250
Hey, give me your hand for a sec.

00:18:20.250 --> 00:18:20.960
Huh?

00:18:20.960 --> 00:18:22.540
Nope, nope, nope.

00:18:22.960 --> 00:18:25.170
Sto... Wai... Kubo-san.

00:18:26.040 --> 00:18:27.380
They are cold.

00:18:29.750 --> 00:18:31.330
How long did you wait?

00:18:31.630 --> 00:18:34.420
Er, not long at all, like a minute or two.

00:18:40.420 --> 00:18:42.080
Maybe about twenty minutes?

00:18:42.880 --> 00:18:43.750
Oh, okay.

00:18:44.960 --> 00:18:47.630
So I should've come right away
instead of picking this out.

00:18:50.250 --> 00:18:52.290
Huh? What's this?

00:18:52.290 --> 00:18:53.880
A Christmas present.

00:18:56.000 --> 00:18:59.420
I thought we could do a gift exchange.

00:19:00.000 --> 00:19:01.710
You didn't tell me that.

00:19:02.330 --> 00:19:03.830
Yeah, I didn't.

00:19:06.500 --> 00:19:09.040
So go buy me a present.

00:19:09.500 --> 00:19:11.250
You know, since I bought you one and all.

00:19:11.580 --> 00:19:13.290
Buy you a gift...

00:19:14.580 --> 00:19:15.830
Hurry!

00:19:16.290 --> 00:19:18.790
You've got fifteen minutes,
and your budget is 1,000 yen.

00:19:19.830 --> 00:19:21.330
This is so sudden!

00:19:22.330 --> 00:19:24.960
I've been looking forward to today.

00:19:27.000 --> 00:19:29.790
All right. Fifteen minutes, right?

00:19:29.790 --> 00:19:33.000
W-wait right here. I'll be back.

00:19:34.580 --> 00:19:35.380
M'kay!

00:19:38.630 --> 00:19:40.250
Here? For real?

00:19:42.380 --> 00:19:44.290
I'm still excited though.

00:19:45.670 --> 00:19:47.710
I told her to wait...

00:19:49.080 --> 00:19:51.540
But I have zero idea what I should buy.

00:19:52.630 --> 00:19:56.380
Plus, it's so hard going into shops
that sell things girls like!

00:19:57.540 --> 00:19:59.540
It's already been fifteen minutes.

00:20:01.880 --> 00:20:06.040
If I don't decide quickly, then soon
Kubo-san will be the one with cold hands.

00:20:12.130 --> 00:20:13.290
He's late.

00:20:16.630 --> 00:20:18.330
My nose is turning red.

00:20:21.210 --> 00:20:22.290
Kubo-san!

00:20:24.130 --> 00:20:25.630
Sorry I'm late!

00:20:29.380 --> 00:20:30.960
And I'm sorry for one more thing.

00:20:31.210 --> 00:20:32.210
For what?

00:20:33.880 --> 00:20:36.130
I told them it'd be used right away,

00:20:37.000 --> 00:20:39.540
so it's not wrapped even though it's a gift.

00:20:40.290 --> 00:20:43.290
I'm sorry it doesn't really feel like a present.

00:20:44.380 --> 00:20:46.540
I didn't know what would be a good gift.

00:20:47.040 --> 00:20:47.750
Hmm.

00:20:47.750 --> 00:20:51.960
But I thought about how your hands might be cold now.

00:20:51.960 --> 00:20:52.710
Hmm.

00:20:53.460 --> 00:20:58.040
I told myself be quick,
but I hemmed and hawed over the color.

00:20:58.040 --> 00:21:00.210
And so I took too long.

00:21:00.580 --> 00:21:01.380
Hmm.

00:21:02.790 --> 00:21:03.580
Er.

00:21:04.500 --> 00:21:07.380
You really put a lot of thought into this.

00:21:08.250 --> 00:21:11.040
Oh my gosh, I love them so much!

00:21:17.040 --> 00:21:18.250
Do they look good on me?

00:21:19.710 --> 00:21:20.580
Yeah.

00:21:22.080 --> 00:21:23.210
But I...

00:21:25.500 --> 00:21:29.420
Might wanna get you a different gift instead.

00:21:30.170 --> 00:21:31.540
What is it?

00:21:32.040 --> 00:21:40.330
<b>Main</b>

00:21:32.040 --> 00:21:40.330
<b>character</b>

00:21:32.420 --> 00:21:37.960
A highlighter yellow T-shirt
that says "main character."

00:21:40.580 --> 00:21:44.210
I thought it might help you stand out. Sorry.

00:21:44.790 --> 00:21:46.500
Well, honestly...

00:21:47.290 --> 00:21:49.380
I didn't think I'd be getting anything,

00:21:49.380 --> 00:21:51.540
so I'm just happy to be getting something at all.

00:21:53.790 --> 00:21:57.210
Ah, I didn't mean that I dislike what you got me.

00:21:57.880 --> 00:21:59.710
You're being honest with me?

00:22:01.000 --> 00:22:01.750
Yeah.

00:22:04.210 --> 00:22:05.170
I am.
